{
  "matthew.27.p1.b1": {
    "text": "夜が明けると、祭司長たち、民の長老たち一同は、イエスを殺そうとして協議をこらした上、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p1.b2": {
    "text": "イエスを縛って引き出し、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p1.b3": {
    "text": "総督ピラトに渡した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p2.b1": {
    "text": "そのとき、イエスを裏切ったユダは、イエスが罪に定められたのを見て後悔し、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p2.b2": {
    "text": "銀貨三十枚を祭司長、長老たちに返して",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p2.b3": {
    "text": "わたしは罪のない人の血を売るようなことをして、罪を犯しました",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p2.b4": {
    "text": "それは、われわれの知ったことか。自分で始末するがよい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p3.b1": {
    "text": "そこで、彼は銀貨を聖所に投げ込んで",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p3.b2": {
    "text": "出て行き、首をつって死んだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p3.b3": {
    "text": "これは血の代価だから、宮の金庫に入れるのはよくない",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p4.b1": {
    "text": "そこで彼らは協議の上、外国人の墓地にするために、その金で陶器師の畑を買った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p4.b2": {
    "text": "そのために、この畑は今日まで血の畑と呼ばれている。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p4.b3": {
    "text": "こうして預言者エレミヤによって言われた言葉が、成就したのである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p4.b4": {
    "text": "彼らは、値をつけられたもの、すなわち、イスラエルの子らが値をつけたものの代価、銀貨三十を取って … 主がお命じになったように、陶器師の畑の代価として、その金を与えた",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:9-10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p5.b1": {
    "text": "さて、イエスは総督の前に立たれた。すると総督はイエスに尋ねて言った",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p5.b2": {
    "text": "あなたがユダヤ人の王であるか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p5.b3": {
    "text": "そのとおりである",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p5.b4": {
    "text": "あんなにまで次々に、あなたに不利な証言を立てているのが、あなたには聞えないのか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p6.b1": {
    "text": "さて、祭のたびごとに、総督は群衆が願い出る囚人ひとりを、ゆるしてやる慣例になっていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p6.b2": {
    "text": "ときに、バラバという評判の囚人がいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p6.b3": {
    "text": "おまえたちは、だれをゆるしてほしいのか。バラバか、それとも、キリストといわれるイエスか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p6.b4": {
    "text": "彼らがイエスを引きわたしたのは、ねたみのためであることが、ピラトにはよくわかっていたからである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p7.b1": {
    "text": "また、ピラトが裁判の席についていたとき、その妻が人を彼のもとにつかわして",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p7.b2": {
    "text": "あの義人には関係しないでください。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p7.b3": {
    "text": "わたしはきょう夢で、あの人のためにさんざん苦しみましたから",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p8.b1": {
    "text": "しかし、祭司長、長老たちは、バラバをゆるして、イエスを殺してもらうようにと、群衆を説き伏せた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p8.b2": {
    "text": "ふたりのうち、どちらをゆるしてほしいのか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p8.b3": {
    "text": "バラバの方を",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p8.b4": {
    "text": "それではキリストといわれるイエスは、どうしたらよいか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p8.b5": {
    "text": "あの人は、いったい、どんな悪事をしたのか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p8.b6": {
    "text": "十字架につけよ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p9.b1": {
    "text": "ピラトは手のつけようがなく、かえって暴動になりそうなのを見て、水を取り、群衆の前で手を洗って言った",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p9.b2": {
    "text": "この人の血について、わたしには責任がない。おまえたちが自分で始末をするがよい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p9.b3": {
    "text": "その血の責任は、われわれとわれわれの子孫の上にかかってもよい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p10.b1": {
    "text": "そこで、ピラトはバラバをゆるしてやり、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p10.b2": {
    "text": "イエスをむち打ったのち、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p10.b3": {
    "text": "十字架につけるために引きわたした。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p11.b1": {
    "text": "それから総督の兵士たちは、イエスを官邸に連れて行って、全部隊をイエスのまわりに集めた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p11.b2": {
    "text": "そしてその上着をぬがせて、赤い外套を着せ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p11.b3": {
    "text": "ユダヤ人の王、ばんざい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p11.b4": {
    "text": "また、イエスにつばきをかけ、葦の棒を取りあげてその頭をたたいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p12.b1": {
    "text": "こうしてイエスを嘲弄したあげく … 元の上着を着せ、それから十字架につけるために引き出した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p12.b2": {
    "text": "彼らが出て行くと、シモンという名のクレネ人に出会ったので、イエスの十字架を無理に負わせた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p12.b3": {
    "text": "そして、ゴルゴタ、すなわち、されこうべの場、という所にきたとき、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p12.b4": {
    "text": "彼らはにがみをまぜたぶどう酒を飲ませようとしたが、イエスはそれをなめただけで、飲もうとされなかった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p13.b1": {
    "text": "彼らはイエスを十字架につけてから、くじを引いて、その着物を分け、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p13.b2": {
    "text": "そこにすわってイエスの番をしていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p13.b3": {
    "text": "そしてその頭の上の方に、「これはユダヤ人の王イエス」と書いた罪状書きをかかげた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p13.b4": {
    "text": "同時に、ふたりの強盗がイエスと一緒に、ひとりは右に、ひとりは左に、十字架につけられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p14.b1": {
    "text": "そこを通りかかった者たちは、頭を振りながら、イエスをののしって",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p14.b2": {
    "text": "神殿を打ちこわして三日のうちに建てる者よ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p14.b3": {
    "text": "もし神の子なら、自分を救え。そして十字架からおりてこい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p15.b1": {
    "text": "他人を救ったが、自分自身を救うことができない。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p15.b2": {
    "text": "あれがイスラエルの王なのだ。いま十字架からおりてみよ。そうしたら信じよう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p15.b3": {
    "text": "彼は神にたよっているが、神のおぼしめしがあれば、今、救ってもらうがよい。自分は神の子だと言っていたのだから」。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:43"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p15.b4": {
    "text": "一緒に十字架につけられた強盗どもまでも、同じようにイエスをののしった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:44"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p16.b1": {
    "text": "さて、昼の十二時から地上の全面が暗くなって、三時に及んだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:45"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p16.b2": {
    "text": "エリ、エリ、レマ、サバクタニ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:46"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p16.b3": {
    "text": "それは「わが神、わが神、どうしてわたしをお見捨てになったのですか」という意味である。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:46"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p16.b4": {
    "text": "あれはエリヤを呼んでいるのだ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:47"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p17.b1": {
    "text": "するとすぐ、彼らのうちのひとりが走り寄って、海綿を取り、それに酢いぶどう酒を含ませて葦の棒につけ、イエスに飲ませようとした。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:48"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p17.b2": {
    "text": "待て、エリヤが彼を救いに来るかどうか、見ていよう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:49"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p17.b3": {
    "text": "イエスはもう一度大声で叫んで、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:50"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p17.b4": {
    "text": "ついに息をひきとられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:50"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p18.b1": {
    "text": "すると見よ、神殿の幕が上から下まで真二つに裂けた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:51"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p18.b2": {
    "text": "また地震があり、岩が裂け、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:51"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p18.b3": {
    "text": "また墓が開け、眠っている多くの聖徒たちの死体が生き返った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:52"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p18.b4": {
    "text": "そしてイエスの復活ののち、墓から出てきて、聖なる都にはいり、多くの人に現れた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:53"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p19.b1": {
    "text": "百卒長、および彼と一緒にイエスの番をしていた人々は、地震や、いろいろのできごとを見て非常に恐れ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:54"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p19.b2": {
    "text": "まことに、この人は神の子であった",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:54"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p19.b3": {
    "text": "また、そこには遠くの方から見ている女たちも多くいた。彼らはイエスに仕えて、ガリラヤから従ってきた人たちであった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:55"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p19.b4": {
    "text": "その中には、マグダラのマリヤ、ヤコブとヨセフとの母マリヤ、またゼベダイの子たちの母がいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:56"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p20.b1": {
    "text": "夕方になってから、アリマタヤの金持で、ヨセフという名の人がきた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:57"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p20.b2": {
    "text": "彼もまたイエスの弟子であった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:57"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p20.b3": {
    "text": "この人がピラトの所へ行って、イエスのからだの引取りかたを願った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:58"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p20.b4": {
    "text": "そこで、ピラトはそれを渡すように命じた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:58"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p21.b1": {
    "text": "ヨセフは死体を受け取って、きれいな亜麻布に包み、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:59"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p21.b2": {
    "text": "岩を掘って造った彼の新しい墓に納め、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:60"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p21.b3": {
    "text": "そして墓の入口に大きい石をころがしておいて、帰った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:60"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p22.b1": {
    "text": "マグダラのマリヤとほかのマリヤとが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:61"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p22.b2": {
    "text": "墓にむかってそこにすわっていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:61"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p23.b1": {
    "text": "あくる日は準備の日の翌日であったが、その日に、祭司長、パリサイ人たちは、ピラトのもとに集まって言った、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:62"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p23.b2": {
    "text": "「長官、あの偽り者がまだ生きていたとき、『三日の後に自分はよみがえる』と言ったのを、思い出しました。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:63"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p23.b3": {
    "text": "ですから、三日目まで墓の番をするように、さしずをして下さい。そうしないと、弟子たちがきて彼を盗み出し、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:64"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p23.b4": {
    "text": "そうなると、みんなが前よりも、もっとひどくだまされることになりましょう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:64"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p24.b1": {
    "text": "番人がいるから、行ってできる限り、番をさせるがよい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:65"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p24.b2": {
    "text": "そこで、彼らは行って",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:66"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p24.b3": {
    "text": "石に封印をし、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:66"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p24.b4": {
    "text": "番人を置いて墓の番をさせた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:66"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
